WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.225
Meet Lumen.

00:00:01.225 --> 00:00:06.440
Turn your footage into a clearer, more purposeful video.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:11.190
Start with your story, learn from reference videos,

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:15.195
and keep control of every editing decision.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.056
The Director Timeline connects your footage with specific

00:00:21.056 --> 00:00:27.710
editing ideas: pacing, framing, captions, graphics, and supporting visuals.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:34.451
Review the reasons, adjust the details, and approve only the shots you want.

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:38.459
Match library footage to your scene, choose

00:00:38.459 --> 00:00:41.799
licensed music, or request an AI alternative.

00:00:41.799 --> 00:00:46.328
Lumen can review the rendered result and propose corrections.

00:00:46.328 --> 00:00:50.262
You review the changes before making another version.

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:58.754
Prepare versions for Douyin, TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, and Xiaohongshu.

00:00:58.754 --> 00:01:03.939
Review each cut, cover, caption style, and call to action.

00:01:03.939 --> 00:01:09.302
Download your files, then publish through your own channels.

